[list]
[*]With Outfit Stands Plus installed, having a colonist selected costs less on a large colony. That mod puts an outfit stand button on every colonist, and to find the stands a colonist owns it went through every building you had built, every frame the colonist stayed selected. On a colony of about 9,000 buildings and 48 stands that came to 0.8 ms per selected colonist per frame. It now goes through the colony's outfit stands only, so the cost follows how many stands you have rather than how much you have built.
[*]The button itself works exactly as before, with the same stands in the same order. If a future Outfit Stands Plus update changes how it finds them, Shift Change leaves the button to that mod.
[/list]
